WEBVTT

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:06.140
Fighting by yourself? Are you
 trying to be some kind of hero?

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:08.640
No, I...

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.750
Do you think you're the only one grieving

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:15.520
for Yume, Yukari-sama, or Princess Tagitsu?

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.710
Shidou, Konohana has been fighting as well.

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.910
She has worked with us on researching how

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.480
to remove aradama that are 
fused with the human body.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.040
Thanks to her, our research 
has advanced dramatically.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.790
It may take some time,

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:33.040
but one day, we will be able to remove 
the aradama from your bodies as well.

00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:34.790
Remove the aradama?

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:40.130
Shidou-san, Konohana-san, we will 
not let your battles go to waste.

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:43.260
That goes for Tsubakuro-san as well.

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:55.400
You've been fighting with this 
all this time, haven't you?

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:01.930
Usumidori is an okatana deeply 
tied to my Kurama style.

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:07.330
But I guess I have no choice but 
to leave it with you for now.

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:09.390
Suzuka...

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:12.630
Now if only Yomi-san would come back,

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:14.290
all four of us would be together again.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:16.320
You're right.

00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:22.550
You will all be accompanying 
Akane-sama tomorrow.

00:01:22.550 --> 00:01:24.430
Where are we going this time?

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.780
To visit the deputy director of 
the Sword Administration Bureau,

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:31.180
my sister, Origami Yukari.

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:35.980
You're reviewing the imperial 
guard candidates again?!

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:36.980
Yes.

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:38.610
How do we have time for that?!

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:43.220
We know where Princess Takiri is located, 
and the princess returned with injuries!

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:45.360
You must deploy an imperial guard right away!

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:47.310
You have plenty of ampoules!

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:49.910
And there are no issues with the candidates' 
preliminary compatibility tests!

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:51.840
So why are you doing this?!

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:55.550
The imperial guard must be able to protect 
the princess at the risk of their own lives.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:57.460
I am assessing the level of their morale.

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:00.000
That's what you're doing?

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.540
No one can disobey the princess 
once they receive the aradama.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.650
If you are ordered to 
become a shield and die,

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:08.450
you will offer your life without hesitation.

00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:11.650
Just as Yomi and Tsubakuro Yume have done.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:14.340
As the president of Ayanokouji,

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:17.020
I will make the decisions 
for Ayanokouji's students.

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:18.750
Don't interfere.

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:30.810
I'm warning you. There's no turning back now.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:36.920
<b>Name: Uchizato Ayumu</b>

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:06.880
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:12.850
<b>Episode 17  The Goddesses' Madness</b>

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:13.760
Hiyori-chan.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:18.790
Here, it's milk tea with lots of sugar.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:19.930
Thanks.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:28.110
Still feeling conflicted about things?

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:33.170
After my mother died,
 all I've ever thought about

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:36.490
was killing the great aradama,
 Origami Yukari.

00:04:36.490 --> 00:04:40.000
Akane-sama said that Yukari-sama 
is no longer Princess Tagitsu,

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:43.430
and that she's gone back to being herself.

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:44.780
I know...

00:04:45.780 --> 00:04:47.970
But you're not convinced, are you?

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:54.420
That's so like you, Hiyori-chan. 
You're so straightforward.

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.900
You have your own faults, too.

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.410
You just prioritize swordfighting 
over everything else.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.850
That's true.

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.290
I really want to fight Yukari-sama again.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:06.430
You've already fought with her plenty.

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:09.820
But this time it would be against Origami 
Yukari's actual Niten Ichi style.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:12.200
You're so easy to figure out.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:14.660
I think you're pretty easy to figure out, too.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.390
I am not! I'm just saying you don't change.

00:05:18.390 --> 00:05:20.720
You are you, and I am me.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:24.710
You're right. I think chocolate 
mint tastes like toothpaste.

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:32.840
What are you thinking about?

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:34.400
Nothing.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:38.850
Maybe you could've said that
 you're not sure how to face her?

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:41.830
You see right through me.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:44.530
It's just because you're really easy to read.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:46.770
You're probably right.

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:50.930
I knew about Yukari-sama 
taking in an aradama,

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:54.150
but I didn't know that
it was Princess Tagitsu.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:55.530
Had I known...

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:57.530
Would you have killed Yukari-sama?

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:03.160
I don't know, but I don't think I 
would have accepted the aradama.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.540
Why did you accept it, then?

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:11.800
Because I felt like I wanted 
the power to keep fighting.

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:16.400
No matter the light, it always 
seems to be swallowed by darkness.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:21.700
I thought that I should accept the darkness 
to confront the enormous darkness.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:26.420
That's surprisingly cowardly for the
 first member of the elite guard.

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:27.840
Cowardly, huh?

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:31.590
One of the girls from Osafune said 
something similar that night.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:33.810
I knew my own weaknesses.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:36.560
So I decided to face them.

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:40.790
I would find Princess Tagitsu before 
anyone else and kill her myself.

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.200
I was even prepared to be
 destroyed along with her.

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:46.180
And you are foolish and reckless, too.

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:47.310
That's true.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:51.460
Instead of killing Princess Tagitsu, 
I confused those around me.

00:06:51.460 --> 00:06:54.980
I never imagined that she would be 
split into three conflicting parts.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.090
Whether it's you or Juujou Hiyori,

00:06:57.090 --> 00:07:01.350
must all Heijou students make such 
impulsive and straightforward decisions?

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:06.590
Speaking of, Suzuka, why did 
you accept the aradama?

00:07:06.590 --> 00:07:07.980
I never asked you before.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:13.730
Good grief! You never realized, did you?

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:17.200
Because I didn't want a certain someone
 to get too far ahead of me.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.360
That's the only reason?

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.950
I envy such an admirable opponent.

00:07:23.700 --> 00:07:25.050
You're so dense.

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:33.120
I am sorry for making you wait so long.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.220
This is the last of the final interviews.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.970
Y-Yes, ma'am! Thank you for having me.

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:41.970
There were no issues with the results 
of your compatibility test,

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:44.030
but I want you to 
really think about this.

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:47.090
There are various risks involved in the 
administration of strengthening drugs.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:51.150
Even so, do you still wish to take
 them and join the imperial guard?

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.360
Yes, I do.

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.690
Why do you wish to do so?

00:07:57.690 --> 00:08:00.310
When I was dispatched to 
Kamakura the other day,

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:02.660
I keenly felt my powerlessness.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:04.150
I want to get stronger.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:07.660
I want to get stronger and
contribute to society as a Toji.

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:11.340
What about getting stronger 
with the normal curriculum?

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:14.800
I don't know that I could...

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:22.020
Also, I got to meet someone 
I admire at Kamakura!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.730
She's a really strong Toji,

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:28.310
and I want to quickly become 
a useful Toji like her.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.310
Please excuse me.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:40.070
<b>Rejected</b>

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:49.230
Origami Yukari...

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:56.670
I wasn't expecting the director, who is 
supposed to be recovering in a hospital,

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:59.030
to show up in an armed submarine.

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:03.490
It is fully equipped with
 medical facilities, so I was not lying.

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:06.100
You're no longer an aradama, 
right, Yukari-sama?

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.350
Etou-san!

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:08.420
Y-You...

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:08.970
Yes.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.060
We have inspected her numerous times,

00:09:11.060 --> 00:09:14.350
and no aradama has been detected in her body.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:18.110
But physically, she's still 17 years old.

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:20.400
Shidou-san, Konohana-san,

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:24.140
I'm sorry that we haven't been able 
to remove the aradama from your bodies.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:25.240
It's fine.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:26.870
How did you overcome it?

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:31.510
I didn't overcome it. I was 
cast aside by the aradama.

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:32.770
Cast aside?

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:34.800
We believe that Princess 
Tagitsu expelled herself

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.270
from the director of her own volition.

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:39.090
On that night?

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:41.470
What happened between you 
and Princess Tagitsu?

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:43.450
Juujou, watch your language!

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:49.180
That night, I, who had been assimilated 
by Princess Tagitsu, was defeated by you.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:51.380
We were on the verge of perishing together

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:55.220
when Princess Tagitsu cast aside my 
body and escaped to the netherworld.

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:59.350
The aradama split herself up
 to throw off pursuit.

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:01.690
So you were cut off like 
a lizard's tail, then?

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:06.290
Kanami-chan, you could have 
phrased that more politely.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:10.240
You're right. I'm the tail that 
was cut off and cast aside.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.730
But we can't dwell on that right now.

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:15.330
You mean the three goddesses?

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:19.590
What was once known as Princess
Tagitsu has now split into three.

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:22.670
Princess Tagitsu has been taking 
noro from various places.

00:10:22.670 --> 00:10:25.170
Princess Takiri is in the possession 
of the Ministry of Defense.

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:26.910
The remaining one is...

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:30.710
Princess Ichikishima. They really 
are the three goddesses of Munakata.

00:10:30.710 --> 00:10:32.910
I cannot believe aradama are 
naming themselves after gods.

00:10:32.910 --> 00:10:35.520
Princess Tagitsu is after Princess Takiri.

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:39.110
Why would she be fighting 
another part of herself?

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:43.310
I summoned you all here to explain that.

00:10:43.310 --> 00:10:46.210
And there is also someone I want you to meet.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:50.910
The third remaining part, 
Princess Ichikishima, is here?

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:56.930
My spectrum meter isn't detecting anything.

00:10:56.930 --> 00:11:01.880
This submarine is to hide her from 
Princess Tagitsu. We use various tricks.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:17.850
Etou Kanami and Juujou Hiyori.

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:24.530
I see, so you are here to destroy me.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:29.490
My existence as an individual was brief,
but that was unavoidable.

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:33.280
So very brief...

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:36.120
We wouldn't be protecting you 
if we were going to destroy you.

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.480
This is an aradama? She seems rather...

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:41.010
No, Princess Tagitsu was like this, too.

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:42.790
Like a real person.

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:48.390
Konohana Suzuka and Shidou Maki. 
I was once a part of Yukari.

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:50.640
I know you both well.

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:55.770
She's pretty different
compared to Princess Takiri.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:57.770
You met with Princess Takiri?

00:11:57.770 --> 00:11:59.060
O-O-Oh, yes.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:02.960
Princess Tagitsu learned of Princess 
Takiri's location and attacked.

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:05.450
We have been selected to 
guard Princess Takiri.

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:10.800
I see, so you are all 
heading to Princess Takiri.

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:14.100
No one even wants me.

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:18.020
It is better for us that you remain 
split in three parts, as you are.

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:20.050
We would like to keep it this way.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:23.810
Indeed, perhaps it is for the best.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:27.670
I was discarded by them, anyway.

00:12:28.020 --> 00:12:29.490
Discarded?

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:32.560
Princess Takiri told us to give you to her.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:34.680
She wants your power.

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:37.300
You are going to give me to her?

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:41.620
If she absorbs me,
Princess Takiri's victory will be assured.

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:45.320
Princess Tagitsu will be destroyed, 
and she will win this battle as well.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:49.830
No, the Sword Administration Bureau 
has said it will protect you.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:53.460
Pardon me, but I don't really understand.

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:56.260
What do she mean by being 
absorbed and winning?

00:12:56.260 --> 00:13:01.840
First, we must explain why they 
were split into three parts.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:02.800
Rui-san?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:03.630
Right.

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.370
The spectrumization of noro.

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:10.130
When noro fuse together,
 it forms something like a brain

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:12.260
and will have advanced intelligence.

00:13:12.260 --> 00:13:15.540
In the process, emotions will form, 
and the noro will become an aradama.

00:13:15.540 --> 00:13:20.260
It is said that the first thing every 
aradama feels is a sense of loss.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.830
A sense of loss?

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:25.170
A sense of being deprived of the
 divinity of the tamahagane steel.

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:27.870
In order to assuage this sense of loss, 
which is similar to a hunger,

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:30.570
noro instinctively seeks 
something to bond with.

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:37.650
We can understand this,
 since we have taken in aradama.

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:39.990
That thirst is hard to resist.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:43.060
As their intelligence develops 
with each repeated bonding,

00:13:43.060 --> 00:13:45.790
the feeling of loss turns into anger.

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:49.630
Anger at the humans who stole the 
tamahagane steel that was a part of them.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:54.990
It is thought that this is the fundamental 
reason why aradama attack people.

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:57.890
How ironic that the only weapon
 that can quell an aradama

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:02.640
is what causes them to 
attack in the first place.

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:06.290
Yes, all of this is caused by you humans

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:10.780
stealing the power of the gods 
from us, due to your greed.

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:14.310
Getting back to the point.

00:14:14.310 --> 00:14:18.350
The reason the great aradama that was 
integrated with me split into three parts...

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:20.980
Our intelligence evolved to a high level,

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:23.540
and eventually, we became 
a logical contradiction.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:25.000
A logical contradiction?

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:30.930
Our thoughts toward people split into three,
 and we began to oppose each other.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:36.340
Princess Tagitsu was born from the original 
feelings of anger and resentment.

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:39.470
She wishes to retaliate against the humans.

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:45.270
Meanwhile, Princess Takiri wishes to 
dominate, control, and guide humans.

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:48.340
She intends to reign over 
this world as a god.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:49.360
And you?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:53.970
I sought the reason that 
I exist in this world.

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:58.710
Are we, the aradama, 
really necessary in this world?

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:01.250
What is the reason for the existence
 of something unnecessary?

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:03.700
I sought for it and finally found it.

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:06.500
A way for humans and aradama to combine.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:09.250
A way to evolve the human species.

00:15:09.250 --> 00:15:11.420
A way for humans and aradama to combine?

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:15.330
Yes, the technology to strengthen 
humans with aradama

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:18.050
was made by Princess Ichikishima.

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:20.180
Then you made this power?

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:24.680
I found it. My reason for 
existing in this world.

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:30.180
That night in Kamakura,

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:33.570
we separated from Yukari and 
escaped to the netherworld.

00:15:33.570 --> 00:15:36.630
In order to resolve the 
logical contradiction

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:39.010
which had become seriously 
irreparable enough already,

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:43.190
each of our thoughts were separated,
 and we were made independent individuals.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:47.570
The three goddesses will fight each other, 
the winner will absorb the losers,

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:50.580
and they will ultimately obtain their true 
form that is still in the netherworld.

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:54.210
If the winner obtains the true 
form and becomes an evil god,

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:57.770
then a crisis like the great disaster 
from twenty years will befall us again.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:01.350
First, we need to defend Princess Takiri.

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:04.930
Princess Ichikishima is safe as 
long as she remains in the ocean.

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:07.140
Princess Ichikishima,
 who isn't suited to fighting,

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:10.130
promptly requested the 
protection of Yukari-sama.

00:16:10.130 --> 00:16:13.220
Yes, I have no one to rely on.

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:15.860
Though I also do not feel 
like fighting my own self.

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:18.190
But you're strong when you fight, right?

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:23.010
I am fairly strong, but I won't bother
with things when I know the results.

00:16:23.010 --> 00:16:25.830
More importantly, do you humans 
not intend to side with me?

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:29.040
Someday, all of humanity 
will be fused with aradama,

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:30.770
and you will evolve as a species.

00:16:30.770 --> 00:16:31.830
Don't be ridiculous.

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:34.960
Do you have any idea how 
much we and Yume have...

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:40.340
I am aware that Tsubakuro Yume 
received us rather favorably.

00:16:40.340 --> 00:16:41.720
What about <i>that</i> result?!

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:45.360
Stop. Princess Ichikishima may 
have completed the theory,

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:49.030
but I was the one who completed 
the drug and administered it.

00:16:49.030 --> 00:16:52.190
And I got both the presidents of 
Renpu and Ayanokouji involved.

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:53.760
Maki-san...

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.820
So not only was President 
Takatsu of Renpu involved,

00:16:57.230 --> 00:17:01.070
but President Souraku of Ayanokouji as well.

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:06.200
Yes, and it is also likely that Princess
 Tagitsu is operating out of Ayanokouji.

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:13.760
Princess Ichikishima is essentially the 
most dangerous of the three goddesses.

00:17:13.760 --> 00:17:16.840
Though the most immediate 
risk is Princess Tagitsu.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.670
First, we will be defending Princess Takiri

00:17:18.670 --> 00:17:20.340
in collaboration with 
the Ministry of Defense.

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:22.190
If we can defeat Princess Tagitsu,

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:26.020
we think we might be able to negotiate 
with the remaining two goddesses.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.240
Are there any plans to individually 
defeat or seal away

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:31.670
Princess Ichikishima and Princess 
Takiri at the present time?

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:33.750
That will likely depend on whether or not

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.490
we succeed in beating 
Princess Tagitsu, won't it?

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.690
You are correct.

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:39.990
So we can't destroy their 
main form in the netherworld?

00:17:39.990 --> 00:17:43.430
Because the netherworld is 
considered theoretically infinite.

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:45.350
Unless we have some kind of special link

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:47.240
that can allow us to identify
coordinates from this world,

00:17:47.240 --> 00:17:49.540
it's difficult even to
determine its existence.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.370
Some kind of special link...

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:53.780
That means that there is a special link

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.860
between the three goddesses 
and their main form.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:03.380
Juujou, Etou, do you have a moment?

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:05.140
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:08.140
Sit.

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:11.640
Are you still not able to forgive me?

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:13.550
N-No—huh?

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:13.010
Yes.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:16.400
When you were possessed by 
the aradama twenty years ago,

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:19.900
my mother constantly lamented

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:23.530
that everything was her fault 
until the day she died.

00:18:26.070 --> 00:18:27.850
Juujou, Etou...

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:30.040
I'm sorry.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:31.660
Yukari-sama...

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:37.420
On the day of the great 
disaster twenty years ago,

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:40.500
I was placed in charge of the Special Unit

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:43.800
and faced the final battle 
along with your mothers.

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:48.660
My duty was to push Princess Tagitsu, 
who clung to this world, into the netherworld

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:50.510
and seal the hole back up.

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:54.850
Then Princess Tagitsu fell to the 
depths of the netherworld with Kagari,

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:56.810
scattered, disappeared.

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:02.290
Princess Tagitsu sought for 
a way to avoid annihilation.

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:06.820
She proposed that she would assimilate 
me in exchange for saving them.

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:10.590
I didn't want to lose my friends,

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:13.950
so I accepted the aradama who 
had thousands of victims.

00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:19.210
You know what happened after that.

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.920
I was the only one to survive,

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:25.710
unable to save either Minato or Kagari.

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:32.180
But my mother seemed happy 
up until her death.

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:34.650
Though putting it that way is kind of weird.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.940
She taught me lots about swordfighting,

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:40.610
and she felt proud to have been a Toji.

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.940
Your mother did?

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:45.690
I see.

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:52.640
Kagari and Minato lost 
part of their Toji powers,

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:55.250
and Princess Tagitsu was 
sealed from the inside.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:59.510
Essentially, Minato took charge of half 
of what Kagari was supposed to bear.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:02.420
The effect of that was that both 
of them became something rare

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:04.840
that simultaneously existed in both 
this world and the netherworld.

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:07.890
In this instance, the same effect 
was had on the okatana you possess,

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.590
Chidori and Kogarasumaru.

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:13.660
So that's the reason they resonate 
with each other sometimes.

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.430
We're so late.

00:20:16.430 --> 00:20:20.000
This is bad. If we don't hurry, all the
 food at the dorm will be gone.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.280
No kidding.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:29.570
Huh?

00:20:34.630 --> 00:20:35.450
Stop!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:46.050
You have no choice but to use that now.

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.050
Damn you!

00:20:50.800 --> 00:20:55.330
You should probably hurry, 
while they still draw breath.

00:20:58.140 --> 00:20:59.600
Chidori and...

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:05.700
I wonder if something of our mothers 
remains in Chidori and Kogarasumaru.

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:07.610
What do you mean by "something"?

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:09.860
I'm not sure,

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:13.950
but I was wondering if that's 
what brought us together.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:15.530
Who knows?

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:20.310
Hey, by the way, Princess Ichikishima 
was a pretty strange person, wasn't she?

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:22.670
She's not a person, she's an aradama.

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.710
Yeah! But—huh?!

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:26.090
Now what is it?

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:29.680
I forgot to ask Yukari-sama 
to have a match with me!

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:32.990
You don't want to have a match with her?

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:33.750
Nope!

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:35.290
Wha?

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:44.380
What made you change your mind?

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:52.110
Well, it's no matter.

00:21:52.430 --> 00:21:55.270
You have all overcome a multitude 
of compatibility tests

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:59.120
and have been chosen as the imperial guard 
for the living god, Princess Tagitsu!

00:21:59.460 --> 00:22:03.190
Each of you are expected to protect the 
princess even at the cost of your own life!

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:04.190
Yes, ma'am!

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.840
<b>Next Episode  Aradama Domination</b>
